{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17140","headline":"御沟新柳 · 李观","name":"御沟新柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御沟回广陌，芳柳对行人。\n翠色枝枝满，年光树树新。\n畏逢攀折客，愁见别离辰。\n近暎章台骑，遥分禁苑春。\n嫩阴初覆水，高影渐离尘。\n莫入胡儿笛，还令泪湿巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}